# Power BI Report Server Notes

## Power BI Service

Cloud-based Power BI platform for publishing, sharing and managing reports.

## Power BI Report Server

On-premises report server for hosting Power BI reports and paginated reports inside an organization.

## Key Differences

- Power BI Service is cloud-based.
- Power BI Report Server is on-premises.
- Report Server may not support all latest Power BI Service features.
- Report Server is often used when data must remain inside the organization network.
